[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0129","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0640","title":"Apple Safari WebKit Cookie阻止绕过漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 5.1.4 之前版本中的 WebKit 组件未正确实现\"阻止来自第三方和广告商的 Cookie\"功能，导致远程攻击者可通过设置 Cookie 绕过隐私设置，从而追踪用户浏览行为。该漏洞允许第三方网站在用户配置 Safari 阻止 Cookie 的情况下仍然设置并读取 Cookie，造成用户隐私信息泄露。攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意网站即可利用此漏洞，无需其他特殊权限。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0640"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-12T21:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:59Z","remediation":"升级 Apple Safari 至 5.1.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 WebKit 中第三方 Cookie 阻止功能实现不当的问题。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器隐私设置中手动启用\"阻止所有 Cookie\"作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026785","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0640.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0640","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-0640.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-0640.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0640","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0640","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-0640","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0640.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0640.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-0640"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0068","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0584","title":"Apple Safari 国际域名 URI 伪造漏洞","description":"Apple Safari for Windows 5.1.4之前版本中的国际化域名（IDN）功能未能正确限制URL中使用的字符，远程攻击者可通过在域名中插入同形异码字（homoglyphs，即外观相似的不同Unicode字符）来伪造合法域名，诱导用户访问恶意网站。该漏洞属于输入验证不完善（CWE-20），攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，可能导致用户被钓鱼攻击欺骗，泄露敏感信息。Apple已发布Safari 5.1.4版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0584"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-12T21:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:52Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple Safari 升级至 5.1.4 或更高版本（Windows 平台）。如无法升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用国际化域名（IDN）功能，或使用其他浏览器（如 Chrome、Firefox）替代 Safari 访问不信任的网站，避免点击可疑链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/80088","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026785","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0584.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0584","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0584.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0584.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0584.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0584.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0584.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0584.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-05xx/CVE-2012-0584.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a0a14ea0f3a80067c6bf2249ad236215b48e4418/2012/CVE-2012-0584.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0131","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0648","title":"Apple iTunes 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签内。<value>WebKit 渲染引擎中存在内存损坏漏洞，影响 Apple iTunes 10.6 之前版本。攻击者可通过中间人攻击方式，在用户浏览 iTunes Store 时利用该漏洞触发内存破坏，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞属于缓冲区溢出类型（CWE-119），攻击者无需用户交互即可远程执行恶意代码，CVSS v3 评分为 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0648"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple iTunes 升级至 10.6 或更高版本（通过 Apple 软件更新或手动下载安装），该版本修复了 WebKit 中通过 iTunes Store 浏览触发的内存破坏漏洞。同时将 Safari 升级至 5.1.4 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议避免在不可信网络环境下使用 iTunes Store 浏览功能，并启用网络流量加密（如 VPN）以降低中间人攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52363","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17475","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0648.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0648","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0648.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0648.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0648.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0648.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2012/CVE-2012-0648.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0648.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0648.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0648.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0128","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0639","title":"Apple iTunes WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iTunes 10.6 之前版本中使用的 WebKit 组件存在内存破坏漏洞。当用户通过 iTunes 浏览商店时，中间人攻击者可通过篡改网络流量触发该漏洞，导致内存损坏和应用程序崩溃，进而实现远程代码执行。攻击者需要能够拦截并修改用户与 iTunes Store 之间的通信，攻击复杂度较高，但成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0639"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:59Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple iTunes 升级至 10.6 或更高版本（Apple 官方安全更新 APPLE-SA-2012-03-07-1）。如无法立即升级，建议在受控网络环境中启用 HTTPS 流量检测，避免在不可信网络中使用 iTunes Store 浏览功能，并限制 iTunes 对外部 WebKit 内容的加载权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://se