0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0126","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0637","title":"Apple iTunes WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iTunes 10.6 之前版本中集成的 WebKit 组件存在内存破坏漏洞，攻击者可通过中间人攻击方式在用户浏览 iTunes Store 时向目标系统发送特制数据触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Apple Safari 5.1.4 之前版本及 iTunes 10.6 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。攻击者需要能够拦截并篡改用户与 iTunes Store 之间的网络通信，利用难度较高。Apple 已在 2012 年 3 月发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0637"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:59Z","remediation":"升级 Apple iTunes 至 10.6 或更高版本，同时升级 Safari 至 5.1.4 或更高版本。可通过 Apple Software Update 自动更新，或访问 Apple 官网下载安装最新版本。如无法立即更新，建议在网络层面限制对 iTunes Store 的中间人攻击路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52363","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17469","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0637.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0637","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0637.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0637.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0637.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0637.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/afea9e4d3a1176ab218afc5d6d560a6f135838c1/2012/CVE-2012-0637.json","https://github.co